    about_how_it_works_desc: 'AiTalk.ch helps you automate what you want through our Workflow Builder (Agent Studio). Build powerful automations visually with drag-and-drop—no coding required. Connect to any external service via MCP (Model Context Protocol), use RAG for intelligent document search, and control your flow with If/Else conditions and While loops. Need help getting started? Just describe what you want to automate in plain language, and our AI Agent will generate the workflow for you. All workflows run using your own API key from your chosen provider (OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, Grok, Mistral, or DeepSeek), so your data stays private and under your control.',
