    // Terms of Use
    terms_title: 'Terms of Use for AiTalk.ch',
    terms_section1_title: 'General and Acceptance',
    terms_section1_content: 'These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the AITalk.ch website and services (collectively, the "Service") provided by M-BIZ Global AG ("Company", "we", "us", or "our"). By accessing or using our Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms.',
    terms_section2_title: 'Eligibility',
    terms_section2_content: 'You must be at least 18 years old to use our Service. By using the Service, you represent and warrant that you have the legal capacity to enter into these Terms.',
    terms_section3_title: 'Provided Services',
    terms_section3_content: 'AITalk.ch provides an AI agent and workflow automation platform. Through features such as RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) based knowledge retrieval, visual workflow builder (Agent Studio), external service integration via MCP (Model Context Protocol), and multilingual AI chatbot deployment, we support business automation. Under the Self plan, users use their own AI Provider API keys and Vector DB. Under the Company - Managed plan, a managed service with data sovereignty is provided in Switzerland, Germany, Korea, and the USA based on Microsoft Azure.',
    terms_section4_title: 'User Accounts and Registration',
    terms_section4_content: 'To access certain features of our Service, you may need to create an account. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activities that occur under your account.',
    terms_section5_title: 'User Content and Data',
    terms_section5_content: 'You retain ownership of any content you upload to our Service. By uploading content, you grant us a license to use, process, and store such content solely for the purpose of providing our Service.',
    terms_section6_title: 'AI Provider and External Service Integration',
    terms_section6_content: 'Our Service integrates with multiple AI Provider APIs including OpenAI, Anthropic (Claude), Google (Gemini), xAI (Grok), Mistral, and DeepSeek. Under the Self plan, users are responsible for obtaining and maintaining their own API keys for each Provider, and the respective Provider\'s terms of service and privacy policies apply. Under the Company - Managed plan, AI services are provided through Microsoft Azure, and Azure\'s enterprise terms of service apply.',
    terms_section7_title: 'Acceptable Use Policy',
    terms_section7_content: 'You agree not to use our Service for any unlawful purpose or in any way that could damage, disable, overburden, or impair our Service. Prohibited activities include but are not limited to harassment, spam, or any form of malicious activity.',
    terms_section8_title: 'Privacy and Data Protection',
    terms_section8_content: 'We are committed to protecting your privacy. Our collection and use of personal information is governed by our Privacy Policy, which is incorporated into these Terms by reference.',
    terms_section9_title: 'Intellectual Property Rights',
    terms_section9_content: 'The Service and its original content, features, and functionality are owned by M-BIZ Global AG and are protected by international copyright, trademark, patent, trade secret, and other intellectual property laws.',
    terms_section10_title: 'Third-Party Services and Links',
    terms_section10_content: 'Our Service may contain links to third-party websites or services that are not owned or controlled by us. We have no control over and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party services.',
    terms_section11_title: 'Service Availability and Modifications',
    terms_section11_content: 'We strive to ensure our Service is available 24/7, but we do not guarantee uninterrupted access. We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of our Service at any time with or without notice.',
    terms_section12_title: 'Payment Terms and Billing',
    terms_section12_content: 'Certain features of our Service may require payment. All fees are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. We reserve the right to change our pricing at any time with reasonable notice.',
    terms_section13_title: 'Termination',
    terms_section13_content: 'We may terminate or suspend your account and access to the Service immediately, without prior notice or liability, for any reason, including if you breach these Terms.',
    terms_section14_title: 'Disclaimers and Limitation of Liability',
    terms_section14_content: 'THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, WE DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES AND SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES.',
    terms_section15_title: 'Indemnification',
    terms_section15_content: 'You agree to indemnify and hold harmless M-BIZ Global AG and its affiliates from any claims, damages, or expenses arising from your use of the Service or violation of these Terms.',
    terms_section16_title: 'Governing Law and Jurisdiction',
    terms_section16_content: 'These Terms shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland. Any disputes arising under these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Switzerland.',
    terms_section17_title: 'Dispute Resolution',
    terms_section17_content: 'Any disputes arising from these Terms or your use of the Service shall be resolved through binding arbitration in accordance with the rules of the Swiss Chambers of Commerce.',
    terms_section18_title: 'Force Majeure',
    terms_section18_content: 'We shall not be liable for any failure to perform our obligations due to circumstances beyond our reasonable control, including but not limited to acts of God, war, terrorism, or government actions.',
    terms_section19_title: 'Severability',
    terms_section19_content: 'If any provision of these Terms is found to be unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall continue in full force and effect.',
    terms_section20_title: 'Entire Agreement',
    terms_section20_content: 'These Terms, together with our Privacy Policy and any other legal notices published by us on the Service, constitute the entire agreement between you and M-BIZ Global AG.',
    terms_section21_title: 'Changes to Terms',
    terms_section21_content: 'We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. We will notify users of any material changes by posting the updated Terms on our website with a new effective date.',
    terms_section22_title: 'Contact Information',
    terms_section22_content: 'If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at:',

    terms_section23_title: 'Account Deletion and Re-registration Policy',
    terms_section23_p1: 'Upon account deletion (anonymization) request, your email address will be permanently ineligible for re-registration. This policy is necessary to prevent abuse of free service allocations and maintain platform integrity. We retain a minimal anonymized identifier (hashed email) exclusively for verification purposes, as permitted under GDPR Article 17(3)(e). For exceptional circumstances, contact support@aitalk.ch.',

